  description: "Reveal 1 \"Ultimate Crystal\" monster in your hand, then activate
    1 of these effects. If you control an \"Ultimate Crystal\" monster, you can activate
    1 or 2 of these effects in sequence, instead (and do not have to reveal a monster).\r\n\u25CF
    Take 1 \"Rainbow Bridge\" card or 1 \"Rainbow Refraction\" from your Deck, and
    either add it to your hand or send it to the GY.\r\n\u25CF Special Summon 1 \"Crystal
    Beast\" Monster Card from your hand, Deck, GY, or Spell & Trap Zone.\r\nYou can
    only activate 1 \"Awakening of the Crystal Ultimates\" per turn."
